OL,3,GNEWSADad reflects on 'physical pain' of
OL,4,Alosing son                             
OL,6,FA man whose 11-year-old son died after 
OL,7,Fa complex illness is taking part in a  
OL,8,Fnew art project, aiming to raise       
OL,9,Fawareness of men's mental health.      
OL,11,FRob Pudner's story is one of nine being
OL,12,Fhighlighted in Are You Alright Mate?, a
OL,13,Fnew art installation from Devon-based  
OL,14,FAlright Mate CIC.                      
OL,16,FIt will use large-scale black and white
OL,17,Fportraits and recorded stories to      
OL,18,Fcreate an "opportunity for people to   
OL,19,Fstop, look and think about how they,   
OL,20,Fand the people around them, are really 
OL,21,Fdoing", the group said.                
