OL,3,GNEWSADad reflects on 'physical pain' of
OL,4,Alosing son                             
OL,6,FPudner said: "I'd lost my mum, I'd lost
OL,7,Fgrandparents, lost other close friends,
OL,8,Fbut to lose a child is the most        
OL,9,Fheart-breaking thing. I'd never felt   
OL,10,Fpain like it in my life, a real        
OL,11,Fphysical pain."                        
